WEBVTT

00:01.100 --> 00:04.110
Remember when kids' software came in a box?

00:06.000 --> 00:07.480
You brought it home.

00:07.500 --> 00:09.243
You put in the disc.

00:10.350 --> 00:12.319
A rabbit taught you to read.

00:12.650 --> 00:14.582
A spaceship taught you math.

00:16.000 --> 00:17.370
It was fun.

00:17.500 --> 00:18.959
It was yours.

00:21.200 --> 00:23.124
Then something changed.

00:23.900 --> 00:26.180
Everything became a subscription.

00:26.200 --> 00:27.380
Free trials.

00:27.400 --> 00:28.580
Monthly fees.

00:28.600 --> 00:29.380
Ads.

00:29.400 --> 00:30.280
Streaks.

00:30.300 --> 00:32.471
Anything to keep them tapping.

00:33.300 --> 00:37.237
And somewhere along the way, our kids stopped being the customer,

00:38.050 --> 00:39.942
and became the product.

00:41.900 --> 00:44.090
We think kids deserve better.

00:45.000 --> 00:48.486
So we're making games that are fun, and yours, again.

00:48.950 --> 00:51.166
PNW Kid Software.

00:52.600 --> 00:53.776
Math.

00:53.933 --> 00:55.119
Reading.

00:55.267 --> 00:56.514
Writing.

00:56.600 --> 00:57.802
Typing.

00:57.933 --> 00:59.083
Coding.

00:59.267 --> 01:00.568
Language.

01:00.600 --> 01:01.892
Feelings.

01:01.933 --> 01:03.167
Making.

01:03.187 --> 01:04.495
And bugs.

01:07.567 --> 01:09.097
Fully private.

01:09.117 --> 01:10.430
No ads.

01:10.450 --> 01:11.763
No accounts.

01:11.783 --> 01:13.097
No tracking.

01:13.117 --> 01:15.130
We collect nothing at all.

01:15.367 --> 01:16.847
Always free to try.

01:16.867 --> 01:18.400
Then $4.99.

01:18.420 --> 01:19.580
Once.

01:19.783 --> 01:21.097
No subscription.

01:21.117 --> 01:22.196
Ever.

01:23.617 --> 01:25.319
Tested by kids.

01:25.783 --> 01:27.724
Shaped with educators.

01:29.650 --> 01:31.913
Software that's fun again.
